		<profileDesc>
			<abstract>
				<p>We present a new OT-based two-party multiplication protocol that is almost as efficient as Gilboa&apos;s semi-honest protocol (Crypto &apos;99), but has a high-level of security against malicious adversaries without further compilation. The achieved security suffices for many applications, and, assuming DDH, can be cheaply compiled into full security.</p>
			</abstract>
